<description>&lt;p&gt;Mass killings of Orthodox Christians have resumed in Oromia, with at least 60 people killed in attacks in Arsi and another 55 reported killed in road-blockade incidents, according to the Ethiopian church. A senior TPLF commander, John Medid, was captured in central Tigray by forces linked to the TPLF. Over 35,000 people have fled the fighting across the border into Moyale, Kenya, prompting condemnation from regional leaders. The UN mission in Somalia has concluded, while the UN food programme appointed a new head amid the renewed conflict.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE9lRnAyWFN6S1Q2cWx6b2pXZk1IblNMX3g0d1lpRXhqYWFPdnp4R3ctUmlnQlcyeUlJM3lldzFKVW9WdENxc21uUm9xOUg2Sy1PYV80U2VvWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE92bm0xcTFfYzhLRmRCUWRZY1hmWUdhOUctX1JVVzFMelFDcUhhZ3NPVDZfcDk3dXR6Q3NuTlh2SmZlR0I4SWYwTzd3eG4wNlBVTVpldVNwb2ZVcmdiYWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPT3JxbzVvSzNCNW5jVUcxbTRjdW9ORkViM2lxSmVXb3VHa3dSWkUzOHBXYUxfV1JVbVEtc28td0dtLUJHNVFnVlFJNFJrcXpFWURnWlFaUnQ3WmtxcnVWNkpUeDNoZm8tcHhTdzkwckRQeTZXMmI3eDRpeGpYMnVzLQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;APAnews - Agence de Presse Africaine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNSEd1QjgxT2VoSnZKWVhpNFlkT2lSUk9pMGlzamZoT25FTkxBWUlQeUNBVGwzUV92Vi1meE9xRkQ5N0N0cjhZeVNEYTE4Nml1Z3AwM2dpakpyMnhmOTU2MlJnRXhVWEMyM3UyTF9FWjlOWjQ3OXN5Y3ZFdXBnVjBkSEVxUEpTekJCV3BodHdXcnpTOHpyYVJ3LUl5WmZYUXNVaUZacGk1a0pvMXBFbklLaEs4VWtKcDI5bktaLV84TnpIbUk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Reporter Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiakFVX3lxTE5HUEhFbXlXMUoxSEN5QUxkTk8xRV9PMUFyWDdFTTRiTUVscjBUVm5tVEhfdGJ2TW90ZGIxaHpnR0FSVWwtUk1SSkVwUnpqc19GQmJPSGZRU2JYZkxSNFhQZVJWU0hNRWdUTHc?